ire venue, until she runs into some trouble at the cosplay plaza. And then, a handsome cosplayer saves her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g0kBsrQxl8TDGUcifB3RWevmmbe.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11979","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21686","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32899","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68188","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316814","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"20952","synopsis":"The anime Mirage Saga is hosting a Valentine's event, and Kae decides to make a chocolate for Shun for the event. As Kae fusses over what chocolate to make in order to perfectly capture Shion's beauty, Nishina suggests Kae try making a 3-D chocolate sculpture. Kae agrees, and throws herself into making one, but is unable to improve in her ability to sculpt the chocolate at all. Nishina can't bear to see Kae saddened by her situation, so suggests Kae use the chocolate she made instead. What will Kae decide to do?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pFIu9fh0LxRsNSzx0JN3FI1k8GJ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"The anime Mirage Saga is hosting a Valentine's event, and Kae decides to make a chocolate for Shun for the event. As Kae fusses over what chocolate to make in order to perfectly capture Shion's beauty, Nishina suggests Kae try making a 3-D chocolate sculpture. Kae agrees, and throws herself into making one, but is unable to improve in her ability to sculpt the chocolate at all. Nishina can't bear to see Kae saddened by her situation, so suggests Kae use the chocolate she made instead. What will Kae decide to do?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pFIu9fh0LxRsNSzx0JN3FI1k8GJ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11979","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21686","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32899","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68188","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316814","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"20958","synopsis":"A new anime, Katchu Ranbu, or Kachu Rabu for short, has started, and it's hugely popular. Bot Kae and Nishina are elated about the show, until they find out that they each ship Lord x Akane and Akane x Lord respectively and get into a huge fight. Their friendship appears to be heading to a halt, so Igarashi, Nanashima, Shinomiya and Mutsumi try to help the pair out. Unfortunately, it looks like their reverse ship war is just heating up.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2A6LjlBhkqIdtACQxwk10m5407A.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"A new anime, Katchu Ranbu, or Kachu Rabu for short, has started, and it's hugely popular. Bot Kae and Nishina are elated about the show, until they find out that they each ship Lord x Akane and Akane x Lord respectively and get into a huge fight. Their friendship appears to be heading to a halt, so Igarashi, Nanashima, Shinomiya and Mutsumi try to help the pair out. Unfortunately, it looks like their reverse ship war is just heating up.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2A6LjlBhkqIdtACQxwk10m5407A.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11979","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21686","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32899","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68188","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316814","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"20954","synopsis":"Everyone goes together on a one night trip in order to attend the death anniversary of Hyakki Sametora, the samurai the lord in Kachu Rabu is modelled after. Both Kae and Nishina are enraptured by the real armor and helmet Akane is modelled after, and a portrait of Sametora. After, Kae and the gang decide to go to a small island in a lake where Sametora's head is rumored to be buried. But what will happen next?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3sjRAeo1ws1L6q5WkNbHZrwbser.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Everyone goes together on a one night trip in order to attend the death anniversary of Hyakki Sametora, the samurai the lord in Kachu Rabu is modelled after. Both Kae and Nishina are enraptured by the real armor and helmet Akane is modelled after, and a portrait of Sametora. After, Kae and the gang decide to go to a small island in a lake where Sametora's head is rumored to be buried. But what will happen next?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3sjRAeo1ws1L6q5WkNbHZrwbser.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11979","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21686","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32899","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68188","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316814","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"20959","synopsis":"After the group's pilgrimage is over, Nanashima begins to notice there's been a change in Kae's relationship with others in the group. Nanashima realizes his only advantage is that he looks like Shion, and with Shion out of the picture, he's lagging behind the rest. While dancing a dance from Puri Puri Moon with his little sister, Nanashima decides he needs to be more proactive. Meanwhile, Kae has decided to take up a part-time job at Usami Land to raise funds for upcoming Kachu Rabu events.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uYoo4tOe7Dghfs91OJi4yu6umCf.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"After the group's pilgrimage is over, Nanashima begins to notice there's been a change in Kae's relationship with others in the group. Nanashima realizes his only advantage is that he looks like Shion, and with Shion out of the picture, he's lagging behind the rest. While dancing a dance from Puri Puri Moon with his little sister, Nanashima decides he needs to be more proactive. Meanwhile, Kae has decided to take up a part-time job at Usami Land to raise funds for upcoming Kachu Rabu events.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uYoo4tOe7Dghfs91OJi4yu6umCf.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11979","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21686","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32899","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68188","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316814","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"20956","synopsis":"The six go to Nishina's holiday house by the ocean to swim. Everyone has fun bodyboarding, eating at a beach hut, and playing beach volleyball. But while doing so, Shinomiya realizes just how unreliable he is and loses confidence in himself. What exactly can he accomplish? After another failed attempt to be useful at the evening barbecue, Shinomiya runs off on his own.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wXWVjjxF5HsoE24t1VhaW6cbh73.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","syno